<!-- ============================================================
  HOW TO CUSTOMISE THIS FILE (read me first)
  1. Search for "EDIT:" comments — every one marks something you
     should change: shop name, phone, email, Formspree ID, products.
  2. Product photos: upload each photo to https://imgbb.com (free),
     copy the "Direct link" it gives you, and paste it into the
     `img` field of that product in the PRODUCTS array below.
     Placeholder images are used until you do this. Photos render
     in full colour with a slight saturation boost for a vibrant,
     professional catalog look.
  3. Orders: create a free form at https://formspree.io, then paste
     your form ID into FORMSPREE_ID below. Without this, orders
     cannot be emailed to you.
  4. Payment: set your real UPI ID in SHOP.upi below. Customers can
     choose Cash on Delivery or UPI at checkout — for UPI they pay
     manually via their own UPI app and enter the transaction ID,
     which is sent to you for verification (no payment gateway).
  5. Order tracking: every order gets a unique Order ID, saved on
     the customer's own device under "My Orders" (top-right icon)
     with a status timeline (Placed / Confirmed / Shipped /
     Delivered). This is a REAL-LOOKING tracker, not an automatic
     one — there's no backend, so the status only changes if you,
     the shop owner, message the customer and they manually check
     back; there's no live courier-style sync between devices. If
     you later want true automatic tracking, you'd need a small
     backend (e.g. Google Sheets + Apps Script) to store order
     status centrally — ask me and I can help set that up.
  6. Login / Sign Up: shown on first visit (and again each new browser
     session if skipped). This is NOT a secure server-based account
     system — there's no backend, so details are saved only on the
     visitor's own device. It's meant to speed up checkout (name/phone
     auto-filled) and greet returning visitors, not to protect an
     account with a password. Every new signup is also emailed to you
     via Formspree so you have a record of who signed up.
  7. Save the file and just double-click it to open in any browser —
     no server, no install, nothing else needed.
=============================================================== -->

